[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13441.63, "timestamp": "03:44:01", "text": "故事？呃，让我来做吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13444.389, "timestamp": "03:44:04", "text": "某物。是的。嗯，布拉德做了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13447.15, "timestamp": "03:44:07", "text": "缩略图。所以，它实际上是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13451.91, "timestamp": "03:44:11", "text": "呃，我害怕地躲在角落里，然后……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13454.91, "timestamp": "03:44:14", "text": "更像是维克和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13458.429, "timestamp": "03:44:18", "text": "嗯，就像Celestial告诉我的那样，“医生，这是……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13461.51, "timestamp": "03:44:21", "text": "好的。我们会保护你之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13463.269, "timestamp": "03:44:23", "text": "起初，我以为两者兼而有之。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13465.11, "timestamp": "03:44:25", "text": "他们好像在嘲笑我什么的。不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13467.59, "timestamp": "03:44:27", "text": "挑衅，更像是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13469.469, "timestamp": "03:44:29", "text": "呃，它叫什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13472.469, "timestamp": "03:44:32", "text": "嗯，不，它叫什么来着？不是茶包，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13475.67, "timestamp": "03:44:35", "text": "但最有可能是为了保护自己。起初，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13477.75, "timestamp": "03:44:37", "text": "我还以为是茶包呢。好吧，让我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13479.67, "timestamp": "03:44:39", "text": "要真实。起初，我以为是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13482.91, "timestamp": "03:44:42", "text": "茶包，但显然是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13486.79, "timestamp": "03:44:46", "text": "不是。并非如此。所以，这是粉丝创作的作品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13488.67, "timestamp": "03:44:48", "text": "哪种面包"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13492.55, "timestamp": "03:44:52", "text": "吸引我。真的有鬼魂出没。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13494.189, "timestamp": "03:44:54", "text": "那里。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13497.429, "timestamp": "03:44:57", "text": "塞莱斯蒂亚。塞拉斯蒂娅看起来好可爱"}]